function weekBounds(week){const m=/^(\d{4})-W(\d{2})$/.exec(week||'');if(!m)return ['',''];const year=+m[1],num=+m[2];const jan4=new Date(Date.UTC(year,0,4));const day=(jan4.getUTCDay()+6)%7;jan4.setUTCDate(jan4.getUTCDate()-day+7*(num-1));const monday=jan4.toISOString().slice(0,10);jan4.setUTCDate(jan4.getUTCDate()+6);return [monday,jan4.toISOString().slice(0,10)];}
function updateReportVehicleOptions(){const selected=$('vehicleFilter').value;const typ='all';const regs=[...new Set([...db.safaris.map(r=>r.reg),...db.vehicleExpenses.map(e=>e.reg)])].sort().filter(r=>typ==='all'||typeFor(r)===typ);$('vehicleFilter').innerHTML='<option value="all">All registrations</option>'+regs.map(r=>`<option value="${escapeHtml(r)}">${escapeHtml(r)}</option>`).join('');$('vehicleFilter').value=regs.includes(selected)?selected:'all';}
function reportData(){const period=$('reportPeriod').value;const month=$('month').value;const day=$('reportDate').value;const year=$('reportYear').value;const week=$('reportWeek').value;const [weekStart,weekEnd]=weekBounds(week);const customStart=$('customFrom')?.value||'',customEnd=$('customTo')?.value||'',q=Number($('quarter')?.value||1);const key=period==='custom'?customStart+' to '+customEnd:period==='quarterly'?year+' Q'+q:period==='daily'?day:period==='weekly'?weekStart+' to '+weekEnd:period==='annual'?year:month;const label=period==='custom'?'Custom':period==='quarterly'?'Quarterly':period==='daily'?'Daily':period==='weekly'?'Weekly':period==='annual'?'Annual':'Monthly';const vehicle=$('vehicleFilter').value;const vehicleType='all';const isVehicle=r=>(vehicle==='all'||r===vehicle)&&(vehicleType==='all'||typeFor(r)===vehicleType);const chosen=db.safaris.filter(r=>isVehicle(r.reg));const matches=date=>!date?false:period==='custom'?!!customStart&&!!customEnd&&date>=customStart&&date<=customEnd:period==='quarterly'?date.slice(0,4)===year&&Math.ceil(Number(date.slice(5,7))/3)===q:period==='daily'?date===day:period==='weekly'?date>=weekStart&&date<=weekEnd:period==='annual'?date.slice(0,4)===year:date.slice(0,7)===month;const safaris=chosen.filter(r=>matches(r.start));const ids=new Set(chosen.map(r=>r.id));const safariExpenses=db.expenses.filter(e=>ids.has(e.safariId)&&matches(e.date));const vehicleExpenses=db.vehicleExpenses.filter(e=>isVehicle(e.reg)&&matches(e.date));const reportType=$("reportType").value;const expenses=reportType==="safari"?safariExpenses:reportType==="maintenance"?vehicleExpenses:[...safariExpenses,...vehicleExpenses];const maintenance=vehicleExpenses.reduce((s,e)=>s+expUSD(e),0);const income=reportType==="maintenance"?0:safaris.reduce((s,r)=>s+recIncome(r),0),cost=expenses.reduce((s,e)=>s+expUSD(e),0);const payments=reportType==="maintenance"?[]:db.payments.filter(p=>ids.has(p.safariId)&&matches(p.date));const received=reportType==="maintenance"?0:payments.reduce((s,p)=>s+payUSD(p),0)+chosen.filter(r=>matches(r.start)).reduce((s,r)=>s+(r.legacyReceivedMigrated?0:Number(r.received||0)),0);const balance=reportType==="maintenance"?0:safaris.reduce((s,r)=>s+recIncome(r)-recReceived(r),0);return{period,label,key,month,vehicle,vehicleType,reportType,safaris:reportType==="maintenance"?[]:safaris,expenses,payments,income,received,balance,cost,maintenance:reportType==="safari"?0:maintenance,cash:received-cost,profit:income-cost};}
function updateReportPeriod(){const period=$('reportPeriod').value;$('reportDateLabel').style.display=period==='daily'?'':'none';$('reportWeekLabel').style.display=period==='weekly'?'':'none';$('reportMonthLabel').style.display=period==='monthly'?'':'none';$('reportYearLabel').style.display=['annual','quarterly'].includes(period)?'':'none';$('customRange')?.classList.toggle('hidden',period!=='custom');$('quarterWrap')?.classList.toggle('hidden',period!=='quarterly');renderReports();}
$('reportType').addEventListener('change',renderReports);$('reportPeriod').addEventListener('change',updateReportPeriod);$('reportDate').addEventListener('change',renderReports);$('reportWeek').addEventListener('change',renderReports);$('reportYear').addEventListener('change',renderReports);

function fundingLabel(e){return e.source==='personal'?'Personal funds':e.source==='business'?'Business funds':e.source==='capital'?'Legacy capital (review)':'Unclassified (review)';}
function fundingRows(d){const convert=d.reportType==='maintenance'?expTZS:expUSD;const unit=d.reportType==='maintenance'?'TZS':'USD';const total=a=>a.reduce((n,e)=>n+convert(e),0);return [['Safari expenses ('+unit+')',total(d.expenses.filter(e=>e.safariId))],['Maintenance expenses ('+unit+')',total(d.expenses.filter(e=>!e.safariId))],...['Personal funds','Business funds','Legacy capital (review)','Unclassified (review)'].map(k=>[k+' ('+unit+')',total(d.expenses.filter(e=>fundingLabel(e)===k))]),['Paid hire days',d.safaris.reduce((n,r)=>n+Number(r.days||0),0)],...(window.ownerReportRows?.(d)||[])];}
function fundingHTML(d){return '<h3>Vehicle funding breakdown</h3><table>'+fundingRows(d).map(([k,v])=>'<tr><td>'+escapeHtml(k)+'</td><td>'+Number(v).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:2})+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</table><p>Allocated owner repayments are excluded from vehicle profit. Owner balances are all-time, not period totals. Revenue by safari start date; expenses by transaction date.</p>';}
function renderReports(){const d=reportData();if(d.reportType==='maintenance'){const total=d.expenses.reduce((sum,e)=>sum+expTZS(e),0);$('reportSelectedName').textContent='Selected report: Vehicle Maintenance Report · '+d.label+' · '+(d.vehicle==='all'?'All registrations':d.vehicle)+' · TZS';$('reports').querySelector('h2').textContent='Vehicle Maintenance Report · '+d.label+' (TZS)';for(const id of ['rIncome','rReceived','rBalance','rCash'])$(id).textContent='—';for(const id of ['rCost','rMaintenance'])$(id).textContent=tzsMoney(total);$('rProfit').textContent='—';$('reportList').innerHTML='<h3>Vehicle maintenance expenses ('+d.expenses.length+')</h3>'+(d.expenses.map(e=>`<div class="entry"><strong>${escapeHtml(e.type)}${e.description?' · '+escapeHtml(e.description):''}</strong><small>${escapeHtml(e.date)} · ${escapeHtml(e.reg)} · ${tzsMoney(expTZS(e))} · ${fundingLabel(e)}</small></div>`).join('')||'<p class="hint">No maintenance expenses in this period.</p>')+'<h3>Total maintenance: '+tzsMoney(total)+'</h3>'+fundingHTML(d);return;}$('reportSelectedName').textContent='Selected report: '+({safari:'Safari Financial Report',maintenance:'Vehicle Maintenance Report',overall:'Overall Business Report'})[d.reportType]+' · '+d.label+' · '+(d.vehicle==='all'?'All registrations':d.vehicle);$('reports').querySelector('h2').textContent=({safari:'Safari Financial Report',maintenance:'Vehicle Maintenance Report',overall:'Overall Business Report'})[d.reportType]+' · '+d.label; $('rIncome').textContent=money(d.income);$('rReceived').textContent=money(d.received);$('rBalance').textContent=money(d.balance);$('rCost').textContent=money(d.cost);$('rMaintenance').textContent=money(d.maintenance);$('rCash').textContent=money(d.cash);$('rProfit').textContent=money(d.profit);$('reportList').innerHTML=`<h3>Payments received (${d.payments.length})</h3>`+(d.payments.map(p=>{const r=db.safaris.find(x=>x.id===p.safariId);return `<div class="entry"><strong>${escapeHtml(p.type)} · ${money(payUSD(p))}</strong><small>${p.date} · ${escapeHtml(r?.reg||'')} · ${escapeHtml(r?.customer||'')}</small></div>`}).join('')||'<p class="hint">No dated payments in this period.</p>')+`<h3>Safaris (${d.safaris.length})</h3>`+(d.safaris.map(r=>`<div class="entry"><strong>${escapeHtml(r.reg)} · ${escapeHtml(r.customer)}</strong><small>${r.start}–${r.end} · ${r.days} paid days · ${money(recIncome(r))} expected · ${money(recReceived(r))} received · ${money(recIncome(r)-recReceived(r))} balance · ${statusLabel(r)} · <b>${paymentStatus(r)}</b>${r.paymentDueDate?' · Due '+escapeHtml(r.paymentDueDate):''}</small></div>`).join('')||'<p class="hint">No safaris start in the selected period.</p>')+`<h3>Expenses in selected period (${d.expenses.length})</h3>`+(d.expenses.map(e=>{const r=db.safaris.find(x=>x.id===e.safariId);return `<div class="entry"><strong>${escapeHtml(e.type)}${e.description?' · '+escapeHtml(e.description):''}</strong><small>${e.date} · ${escapeHtml(e.reg||r?.reg||'')} · ${e.currency} ${Number(e.amount).toLocaleString()} · ${money(expUSD(e))} · ${fundingLabel(e)}</small></div>`}).join('')||'<p class="hint">No expenses in the selected period.</p>')+fundingHTML(d);}
$('month').addEventListener('change',renderReports);$('vehicleFilter').addEventListener('change',renderReports);
function download(name,blob){const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),10000)}
function reportName(ext){const d=reportData();return 'Alanana_'+d.reportType+'_'+d.period+'_'+d.key+'_'+(d.vehicle==='all'?'All_Vehicles':d.vehicle.replace(/[^a-z0-9]/gi,'_'))+'.'+ext}
$('pdfBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>{const d=reportData();if(d.reportType==='maintenance'){const total=d.expenses.reduce((sum,e)=>sum+expTZS(e),0);const rows=d.expenses.map(e=>`<tr><td>${escapeHtml(e.date)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(e.reg)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(e.type)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(e.description||'')}</td><td>${tzsMoney(expTZS(e))}</td><td>${fundingLabel(e)}</td></tr>`).join('');const reportHtml=`<!doctype html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>Alanana Vehicle Maintenance Report</title><style>body{font:13px Arial,sans-serif;color:#173b30;padding:20px}h1{font-size:22px}h2{font-size:16px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{border:1px solid #b9c9c0;padding:7px;text-align:left}th{background:#e6eee9}@media print{.alanana-report-tools{display:none!important}body{padding:0}}@page{size:A4 landscape;margin:12mm}</style></head><body>${ALANANA_LOGO_HEADER}<h2>Vehicle Maintenance ${d.label} Report (TZS)</h2><p>Period: ${escapeHtml(d.key)} · Vehicle: ${escapeHtml(d.vehicle==='all'?'All registrations':d.vehicle)}</p><h2>Total maintenance: ${tzsMoney(total)}</h2><table><tr><th>Date</th><th>Vehicle registration</th><th>Category</th><th>Description</th><th>Cost (TZS)</th><th>Funding source</th></tr>${rows}</table>${fundingHTML(d)}<p>All values are in Tanzanian shillings. USD expenses use the manually saved exchange rate for each expense.</p></body></html>`;let overlay=document.getElementById('alananaReportPreview');if(!overlay){overlay=document.createElement('div');overlay.id='alananaReportPreview';document.body.appendChild(overlay);}overlay.innerHTML='<div class="alanana-report-tools"><button type="button" id="alananaCloseReport">Close report</button><button type="button" id="alananaPrintReport">Print / Save as PDF</button><button type="button" id="alananaDownloadReport">Download report (.html)</button></div><div class="alanana-report-paper">'+reportHtml.match(/<body>([\s\S]*?)<\/body>/i)[1]+'</div>';overlay.classList.add('open');overlay.scrollTop=0;document.getElementById('alananaCloseReport').onclick=()=>overlay.classList.remove('open');document.getElementById('alananaPrintReport').onclick=()=>window.print();document.getElementById('alananaDownloadReport').onclick=()=>download(reportName('html'),new Blob([reportHtml],{type:'text/html;charset=utf-8'}));notify('Maintenance report ready in TZS. Choose Print / Save as PDF.');return;}const rows=d.safaris.map(r=>`<tr><td>${escapeHtml(r.reg)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(r.customer)}</td><td>${r.start}–${r.end}</td><td>${r.days}</td><td>${statusLabel(r)}</td><td>${money(r.rate)}</td><td>${money(recIncome(r))}</td><td>${money(recReceived(r))}</td><td>${money(recIncome(r)-recReceived(r))}</td><td>${escapeHtml(paymentStatus(r))}</td></tr>`).join('');const erows=d.expenses.map(e=>{const r=db.safaris.find(x=>x.id===e.safariId);return `<tr><td>${e.date}</td><td>${escapeHtml(e.reg||r?.reg||'')}</td><td>${escapeHtml(e.type)} ${escapeHtml(e.description)}</td><td>${e.currency} ${e.amount.toLocaleString()}</td><td>${e.fx}</td><td>${money(expUSD(e))}</td><td>${fundingLabel(e)}</td></tr>`}).join('');const reportHtml=`<!doctype html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>Alanana ${d.reportType} ${d.label} report ${d.key}</title><style>body{font:13px Arial,sans-serif;color:#173b30;padding:20px}h1{font-size:22px}h2{font-size:16px;margin-top:25px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{border:1px solid #b9c9c0;padding:7px;text-align:left}th{background:#e6eee9}.summary{display:flex;gap:25px;font-size:15px}button{padding:12px;background:#136b4b;color:white;border:0;border-radius:7px}@media print{button{display:none}body{padding:0}}@page{size:A4 landscape;margin:12mm}</style></head><body><button onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>${ALANANA_LOGO_HEADER}<p>${({safari:"Safari Financial",maintenance:"Vehicle Maintenance",overall:"Overall Business"})[d.reportType]} ${d.label} Report · ${escapeHtml(d.key)} · ${escapeHtml(d.vehicle==='all'?'All registrations':d.vehicle)}</p><div class="summary"><p>Expected income <b>${money(d.income)}</b></p><p>Payments received <b>${money(d.received)}</b></p><p>Balance <b>${money(d.balance)}</b></p><p>Expenses <b>${money(d.cost)}</b></p><p>Vehicle maintenance <b>${money(d.maintenance)}</b></p><p>Cash position <b>${money(d.cash)}</b></p><p>Net profit <b>${money(d.profit)}</b></p></div><h2>Payments received in period</h2><p>${d.payments.length?"Payments recorded below.":"No payments recorded in this period. Unpaid safari bookings are still included in the Safari hires table."}</p><table><tr><th>Date</th><th>Vehicle</th><th>Type</th><th>Amount (USD)</th></tr>${d.payments.map(p=>{const r=db.safaris.find(x=>x.id===p.safariId);return `<tr><td>${p.date}</td><td>${escapeHtml(r?.reg||'')}</td><td>${escapeHtml(p.type)}</td><td>${money(payUSD(p))}</td></tr>`}).join('')}</table><h2>Safari hires</h2><table><tr><th>Vehicle</th><th>Customer</th><th>Dates</th><th>Paid days</th><th>Status</th><th>Rate (USD)</th><th>Expected income (USD)</th><th>Received (USD)</th><th>Balance (USD)</th><th>Payment status</th></tr>${rows}</table><h2>Expenses paid in selected month</h2><table><tr><th>Date</th><th>Vehicle</th><th>Expense</th><th>Original amount</th><th>TZS/USD rate</th><th>USD equivalent</th><th>Funding source</th></tr>${erows}</table>${fundingHTML(d)}<p>Safari revenue is recorded by safari start date even when unpaid; payments and expenses by transaction date. Balances reflect all payments for safaris starting in the selected period. USD conversions use the rate saved with each expense.</p></body></html>`;const reportBody=reportHtml.match(/<body>([\s\S]*?)<\/body>/i)?.[1]||reportHtml;let overlay=document.getElementById('alananaReportPreview');if(!overlay){overlay=document.createElement('div');overlay.id='alananaReportPreview';document.body.appendChild(overlay);}overlay.innerHTML='<div class="alanana-report-tools"><button type="button" id="alananaCloseReport">Close report</button><button type="button" id="alananaPrintReport">Print / Save as PDF</button><button type="button" id="alananaDownloadReport">Download report (.html)</button></div><div class="alanana-report-paper">'+reportBody.replace(/<button[^>]*>Print \/ Save as PDF<\/button>/,'')+'</div>';overlay.classList.add('open');overlay.scrollTop=0;document.getElementById('alananaCloseReport').onclick=()=>overlay.classList.remove('open');document.getElementById('alananaPrintReport').onclick=()=>window.print();document.getElementById('alananaDownloadReport').onclick=()=>{const blob=new Blob([reportHtml],{type:'text/html;charset=utf-8'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=reportName('html');document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),30000);};notify('Report ready below. Choose Print / Save as PDF.');});
